      "content": "\"rest in the quiet\" ... that sounds almost peaceful, in a dark way. like i wouldn't have to keep fighting to be noticed or feeling the sting of being ignored every single day. everything just feels so heavy and permanent. like there's no point in trying to fix something that's already fundamentally broken.",
